	(text "AK4621EF codec, as the Timekeeper (IC401). Serial control (P/S high) bit-banged on CSN/CCLK/CDTI. PDN reset by RC.\nMono in: AINL from the ADC driver; AINR+/- are parked at VCOM through 1k each [CONFIRM against the AK4621 datasheet]. Stereo out: AOUTL/AOUTR to the output stages (the Timekeeper wired them crossed; here L is L).\nU501 buffers VCOM: VCOM_A biases the input buffer and the ADC driver input reference, VCOM_B the ADC driver VOCM and the output stages."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
